  "description": "The Order of the Knights Templar was a powerful military order in the Middle Ages, known for their wealth, influence, and later persecution. In modern conspiracy theories, they are often falsely portrayed as secret societies controlling global events, which is referenced in the top text 'support the temple motherfuckers'. This requires knowledge of their historical role and modern misrepresentation.",
